    <statement><p>Multiply the following.
<ol label="a.">
<li>
<p><m>(-10)\cdot(-2)</m></p>
<p><fillin characters="8" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>(-5)\cdot4</m></p>
<p><fillin characters="8" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>5\cdot(-4)</m></p>
<p><fillin characters="8" name="AnSwEr0003"/></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>(-8)\cdot0</m></p>
<p><fillin characters="8" name="AnSwEr0004"/></p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>20</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>-20</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>-20</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>0</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><p>The rules for multiplying positive and negative numbers are:</p>
<p><ul label="disc">
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ \text{positive} \cdot \text{positive} = \text{positive} }</m>,</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ \text{positive} \cdot \text{negative} = \text{negative} }</m>,</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ \text{negative} \cdot \text{positive} = \text{negative} }</m>,</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ \text{negative} \cdot \text{negative} = \text{positive} }</m>.</p>
</li>
</ul></p>
<p>The solutions are:</p>
<p><ol label="a.">
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ (-10)\cdot(-2)={20},  }</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ (-5)\cdot4={-20},  }</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 5\cdot(-4)={-20},  }</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ (-8)\cdot0={0}.  }</m></p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</solution>
